#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:1
#: e622e5d1abc24b0080f61043d5fcf449
msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Quick start"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:3
#: 858c9934b08b44e4a64510b8342c59ed
msgid "本教程将带你走完 UniKT 的完整流程：从下载公开数据集、数据预处理，到训练经典深度知识追踪模型 DKT 并进行独立测试集评估。"
msgstr ""
"This tutorial guides you through the complete UniKT workflow: from "
"downloading and preprocessing a public dataset to training the classic "
"Deep Knowledge Tracing (DKT) model and evaluating it on a standalone test"
" set."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:7
#: 7bcb406d06ed465fa7ac3eab50c1ac93
msgid "准备工作"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:9
#: 230971c80db54558b0e54352ebde9fd9
msgid "确保已按照[环境安装与配置](installation.md)安装了 Pixi 并进入环境："
msgstr ""
"Ensure you have installed Pixi and activated the environment following "
"[Installation & Configuration](installation.md):"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:11
#: 98dd82900f0d48e89b0c0bf0fd20ef36
msgid "pixi shell\n"
msgstr "pixi shell\n"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:17
#: 74fdbc8d9c5646f1ba6a81bffd8c4f12
msgid "步骤 1：下载与处理数据集"
msgstr "Step 1: Download and Process Dataset"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:19
#: dc88260a431b48e28a5dcd8654049bb9
msgid "UniKT 内置了自动化数据流。以最经典且轻量的 **ASSISTments 2009** 数据集为例："
msgstr ""
"UniKT features built-in automated data pipelines. Taking the classic and "
"lightweight **ASSISTments 2009** dataset as an example:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:21
#: 86da8765d5ff4ce09e8d20832881c070
msgid ""
"# 1. 自动从镜像源下载原始数据集压缩包并解压至 data/assistments09/raw\n"
"python data_process.py download -d assistments09\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 清洗、构建题目-技能映射，并生成 5 折交叉验证划分的 Parquet 文件\n"
"python data_process.py process -d assistments09\n"
msgstr ""
"# 1. Automatically download raw dataset archive from mirror and extract "
"to data/assistments09/raw\n"
"python data_process.py download -d assistments09\n"
"\n"
"# 2. Clean, build question-skill mapping, and generate 5-fold cross-"
"validation Parquet files\n"
"python data_process.py process -d assistments09\n"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:29
#: dc5f5c59ffb74a56ba40ac300b7c3f87
msgid "处理完成后，在 `data/assistments09/` 目录下将生成如下标准化产物："
msgstr ""
"Upon completion, the following standardized artifacts are generated in "
"`data/assistments09/`:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:30
#: 1aefcd3c10fa4b52a1b7f6ba675930b6
msgid "`assistments09_sequence.parquet`：清洗后的完整学生答题交互记录。"
msgstr ""
"`assistments09_sequence.parquet`: Cleaned complete student response "
"interaction logs."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:31
#: 5634f8b0c780498e95b46e6bf3b4057c
msgid "`assistments09_split_skill_sequence.parquet`：按技能粒度展开并切片后的序列（标注了所属 fold）。"
msgstr ""
"`assistments09_split_skill_sequence.parquet`: Sliced sequences expanded "
"at the skill granularity (labeled with fold assignments)."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:32
#: 72dc9245045d48e39744aa2859824c0b
msgid "`assistments09_relation_question_skill.parquet`：题目与技能的对应关系二部图表。"
msgstr ""
"`assistments09_relation_question_skill.parquet`: Bipartite relation table"
" mapping questions to skills."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:33
#: 6573504bd8f7492a82f82bea65acea99
msgid "`metadata.json`：数据集全局元数据（用户数、题目数、技能数及校验 Hash）。"
msgstr ""
"`metadata.json`: Dataset global metadata (counts of users, questions, "
"skills, and checksum hashes)."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:37
#: fc49c5f4075040b090f5c06c4590a0b2
msgid "步骤 2：训练基准模型"
msgstr "Step 2: Train a Baseline Model"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:39
#: 775e1937ae9d41be9f8970a7225bbc05
msgid "使用 `train.py` 启动训练。这里以经典模型 **DKT** 为例，在第 0 折上进行训练："
msgstr ""
"Launch training using `train.py`. Here, we train the classic **DKT** "
"model on fold 0:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:41
#: b7ccb16d27554c4db8ead68f83648f78
msgid "python train.py -m DKT -d assistments09 --data.fold 0\n"
msgstr "python train.py -m DKT -d assistments09 --data.fold 0\n"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:46
#: 1375cecaa39b414f97712dbd097d50c6
msgid ""
"UniKT 采用简写参数：`-m` 指定模型名称，`-d` 指定数据集名称。其他参数采用分层命名空间，例如 `--data.fold 0` 指定第"
" 0 折作为验证集。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT uses convenient short flags: `-m` specifies the model name, and "
"`-d` specifies the dataset name. Other parameters use hierarchical "
"namespaces, such as `--data.fold 0` to select fold 0 as the validation "
"fold."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:49
#: 5386e64c17c043329477c3e8dcfc572f
