#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:72
#: 5c909a135f4b41838514529717af30e8
msgid "在训练过程中："
msgstr "During training:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:73
#: c2655b8d78bd4f62829f157734ca833b
msgid "框架自动跟踪早停机制（默认 `patience=10`，监控验证集 AUC）。"
msgstr ""
"The framework automatically monitors early stopping (default "
"`patience=10`, tracking validation AUC)."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:74
#: 63f5b1e2d2ae4aab9a5ed7bcee314604
msgid "每次验证集指标刷新历史最佳时，自动更新 `best_model.pth`。"
msgstr ""
"Whenever validation metrics achieve a new best, `best_model.pth` is "
"updated automatically."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:75
#: 7439100e9ac64329814f0b75a526c090
msgid "每个 Epoch 结束时保存 `last_checkpoint.pth`。"
msgstr "`last_checkpoint.pth` is saved at the end of each epoch."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:76
#: 8da831c5ff9143dca2368db665462791
msgid "训练结束后，自动加载最佳检查点并在留出测试集上运行最终评估。"
msgstr ""
"Upon training completion, the best checkpoint is automatically loaded to "
"evaluate final performance on the held-out test set."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:80
#: b58c0aa570c6458ead5b05f09484212e
msgid "步骤 3：独立测试集评估"
msgstr "Step 3: Standalone Test Set Evaluation"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:82
#: 3d652a6adca34efbaa6d266fd48a69c6
msgid "如果需要重新评测某个已经训练完毕的模型，或者在不同的硬件（例如无显卡的 CPU 机器）上复现测试结果，可以使用 `evaluate.py`："
msgstr ""
"If you need to re-evaluate a trained model or reproduce test results on "
"different hardware (e.g., a CPU server without GPUs), use `evaluate.py`:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:84
#: 154f3a9c915240a780d4324444f68e66
msgid ""
"# 指定实验运行目录进行独立评估\n"
"python evaluate.py --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/DKT_assistments09_20261109-133000_fold0_bs128\n"
msgstr ""
"# Specify run directory for standalone evaluation\n"
"python evaluate.py --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/DKT_assistments09_20261109-133000_fold0_bs128\n"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:90
#: 4e69ddc0ca914e1ea64e3654916056df
msgid ""
"`evaluate.py` 会直接读取运行目录中的 `run_config.yaml` "
"归档文件，自动恢复完整的超参数、模型架构与数据集配置，因此**无需重复指定 `-m` 或 `-d`**。"
msgstr ""
"`evaluate.py` directly reads the `run_config.yaml` archive in the run "
"directory, automatically restoring the full hyperparameters, model "
"architecture, and dataset configuration—**no need to respecify `-m` or "
"`-d`**."

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:93
#: 175aed0155344e4baa63144e963bbcb3
msgid "若需要在 CPU 上执行评估："
msgstr "To run evaluation on CPU:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:95
#: f0b9ba75455a4d409d547cba948f7a5a
msgid ""
"python evaluate.py --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/DKT_assistments09_20261109-133000_fold0_bs128 "
"--general.device cpu\n"
msgstr ""
"python evaluate.py --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/DKT_assistments09_20261109-133000_fold0_bs128 "
"--general.device cpu\n"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:99
#: 22c692c61e95493e9dd99430aa3de7a9
