#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:109
#: 1abffb0457bb457cb6538eefe3710893
msgid "步骤 4：查看实验产物与追踪"
msgstr "Step 4: Inspect Run Artifacts and Tracking"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:111
#: bba0346cd9484af8be577a43ed37682a
msgid "每次训练运行都会在 `runs/normal/<run_id>/` 目录下生成自包含的实验归档文件："
msgstr ""
"Each training run generates a self-contained experiment archive in "
"`runs/normal/<run_id>/`:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:113
#: 3e5752fa51f24d74a452ace2271c383e
msgid ""
"runs/normal/DKT_assistments09_20261109-133000_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── run_config.yaml        # 实验配置完整快照（无损复现的核心依据）\n"
"├── run_metadata.yaml      # 运行时元数据（参数量、GPU 型号、显存峰值等）\n"
"├── best_model.pth         # 验证集最优权重\n"
"├── last_checkpoint.pth    # 最终轮次检查点（用于断点恢复）\n"
"├── metrics_train.csv      # 训练轮次损失与指标明细\n"
"├── metrics_val.csv        # 验证轮次指标记录\n"
"├── timing.csv             # 各阶段耗时分析\n"
"└── run.log                # 完整终端运行日志\n"
msgstr ""
"runs/normal/DKT_assistments09_20261109-133000_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── run_config.yaml        # Full experiment configuration snapshot (key "
"to lossless reproduction)\n"
"├── run_metadata.yaml      # Runtime metadata (parameter count, GPU "
"model, peak memory, etc.)\n"
"├── best_model.pth         # Best checkpoint on validation set\n"
"├── last_checkpoint.pth    # Final epoch checkpoint (for resuming)\n"
"├── metrics_train.csv      # Per-epoch training losses and metrics\n"
"├── metrics_val.csv        # Per-epoch validation metrics\n"
"├── timing.csv             # Phase timing breakdown\n"
"└── run.log                # Full terminal console log\n"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quick-start.md:125
#: 1cbb782e6373447a98adcb2e138f1917
msgid ""
"若在 `.env` 中启用了 SwanLab（`KT_TRACKING_BACKEND=swanlab`），可直接在 SwanLab Web "
"控制台查看动态绘制的损失曲线、AUC/ACC 变化以及多实验横向对比看板。"
msgstr ""
"If SwanLab is enabled in `.env` (`KT_TRACKING_BACKEND=swanlab`), dynamic "
"loss curves, AUC/ACC trajectories, and multi-run comparison dashboards "
"can be viewed directly in the SwanLab Web console."

